    "title": "lyric",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13110796.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170508171112/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13110796.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんにちは、鹿乃です(*⁰▿⁰*)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家好，我是鹿乃(*⁰▿⁰*)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hello, it's Kano(*⁰▿⁰*)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "今日はお手紙を書いています。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "今天我在写信。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Today I'm writing letters."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "qJr9EVTTbV.jpg",
            "media": "ffe4222bd222.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0m0edd26d2e84d280e363e604c2d7b6b3e113a66322128691748326a4a732b64761b5b6e537f427a46405264675b416b672922432c73166a00333c36666d777b1423613d712c407c45626f3d2217333c6e"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "手紙を書きつつ、便箋に今書いている歌詞を書きはじめたらいい感じに言葉がでてくるのかな？と思って、歌詞も書きはじめました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "一边写着信，一边想“要是在信纸上把现在正在写的歌词也写下来，说不定能冒出不错的词句呢？”，于是也开始写起了歌词。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "While writing letters, I thought maybe the words would flow nicely if I started writing the lyrics I'm working on onto the letter paper, so I started writing lyrics too."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "結果は………いつかみんなが今書いている歌詞を聴いたときに心に響いたかどうかで判断してください_(:3」z)_"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "结果如何……等将来大家听到现在写的这些歌词时，请用有没有打动你们来判断吧_(:3」z)_"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The result is………judge it by whether it moves your heart when you hear these lyrics someday_(:3」z)_"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ここ数年は年賀状を書くことがなかったのですが、2017年は形からでもきちんとしよう！と思い今年はお世話になった方に送ってみてました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这几年我都没有写过贺年卡，但心想“2017 年哪怕只是形式上也要好好做起来！”，于是今年试着寄给了关照过我的人们。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I hadn't written New Year's cards for the past few years, but for 2017 I decided to do it properly, at least in form, and sent some to people who've helped me."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "照れくさいし、目上の方に失礼じゃない？マナー間違ってない？て年末にドギマギ（´-`）"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "又害羞，又担心会不会对长辈失礼、礼数有没有搞错，整个年末都忐忑不安的（´-`）"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It's embarrassing, and I was nervous at the end of the year wondering, isn't this rude to my seniors? Did I get the etiquette wrong?(´-`)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "みんなも私宛にお手紙書いてるときはこんな気持ちなのかな。すごく緊張するね笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家给我写信的时候，是不是也是这种心情呢。真的会好紧张呢（笑）"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I wonder if you all feel like this when you write letters to me. It's so nerve-racking lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "いつもありがとう。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "一直以来，谢谢你们。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Thank you, always."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "◆鹿乃2ndライブチケット一般発売中！"
